      <p>No. 80, 2024</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Customs Licensing Charges Act 1997</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 5 September 2024</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
